    {
      "id": "rita-chronical-and-chrono-ascension",
      "title": {
        "en": "Rita Chronical and Chrono Ascension"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30097_srt4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_30097_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Chronical is Rita's own self made and stored AP\nChronicle is gained through Chrono Archon\nChronicle itself can't be spent as AP, first Rita has to Ascend\nRita has 2 ways to Ascend, Ending the turn with Chronicle, or Time Paradox\nIf Rita has any Chronicle at the end of the turn, she will Ascend it next turn start\n6 Chronicle -> 6 Chronical Ascension (Aka Rita AP)\nThe only way to Ascend early is Time Paradox which forcefully\nConverts all Chronicle into Chronical Ascension\nDue to the fact that Chronical Ascension state is lost upon its used up\nAny overflow AP Used will be converted into Chronical\nRita can end turn Chronicle Ascend 6 AP\nRita Generates 6 Chronicle (Only 3 Required if you have Archon 1)\nRita Time Paradoxes for 6 Ascension AP\nRita Generate 6 Chronicle (Only 3 Required if you have Archon 1)\nSo in total, Rita can generate 12 AP, if you use 12 AP in optimal cases\nChrono Archon 1 is broken, you naturally get 6 Chronicle so you only need 6 AP\nTo get 12 Chronical Ascension"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Fate Imprint AP Cost Breakpoints"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_30097_uni3",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Fate Imprint is a very very interesting concept\n144% per AP\n120% x 9 = 1296% Max is not impressive compared to Tipheras CnD"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
