            "en": "E1:\nTime Paradox now makes 8 Chronical Ascension (2 more AP basically) lowkey bricky\nE2:\nGives you a buff card upon entering Ascension, It's a pretty decent multi (60%+ Average)\nE3:\nIncreases max damage buff to 300% (100% more) thats quite a substantial Multi\nE4:\nUp to 30% Multi, but it it's incremental\nE5:\nRita has very high base Multipliers, so potential levels are good (Not Fate Imprint)\nE6:\nWhat the heck? You can get 12 Ascension? One time per battle, but still great setup"
